        "ae36be52-0e56-4829-ac5d-f47fd671d46b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>• Cervical, back, lumbar, sacrum, pelvis, thorax<br\/>• Cervical protection optimised for wearing a certified riding helmet.<br\/>• Continuous hip protection for perfect trunk alignment.<br\/>• Chest protection that is adapted to each size (24% of the chest circumference and 100% of the waist-shoulder length).<br\/>• Back protection also adapted to each size (20% of the chest circumference and 120% of the waist-shoulder length).<br\/>• Better protection of the spine and vital organs thanks to 2 bust heights per size on sizes XS-S-M-L (regular fit \/ slim fit).<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
